  "details": "The Mic Icon being where it was before was honestly fine. In VR, the icon is down there anyways so I think it makes sense to just keep it in the same area. \n\nBeing where it is now at the top right of the screen, and the icon barely even indicating when you speak is poor UI design. Not to mention that if the HUD is hidden, there's no mic indicator.......... (Don't want to see the whole new HUD but want to see the mic icon only)\n\nI personally use the experimental mic icon that people with an OLED VR headset use, and I really want to see it back on desktop.",
